    {
      "text": "hour of your mission is come, D&C 31:3. mission appointed to Edward Partridge, D&C 58:14, 16. Sidney Gilbert and William W. Phelps to be in haste upon mission, D&C 61:7, 9. your mission is not yet full, D&C 62:2. ensample unto all ordained unto priesthood, whose mission is appointed to go forth, D&C 68:2. this is mission for season, D&C 71:3. John’s little book is mission and ordinance to gather tribes of Israel, D&C 77:14 (Rev. 10:2, 9–10). be prepared in all things when I send you again to magnify mission with which I have commissioned you, D&C 88:80. business and mission in all your lives to preside in council, D&C 90:16. David Patten to settle business that he may perform mission, D&C 114:1. mission in store for William Law and Hyrum Smith, D&C 124:102. Joseph Smith has sealed his mission with his blood, D&C 135:3.",
